From f1b1eac47b3166c263c801614e326e17660eab39 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Marc Aldrich <7917445+MarcAldrich@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:03:41 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] xpu-inkling2: native Xe2 XMX vision tower (mmproj-F16
 inkling2v)

Add end-to-end multimodal image support for Inkling-2-Mini (mmproj-F16.gguf / inkling2v):
- vit.cl: Xe2 XMX DPAS F16 GEMM, bilinear 32x32 pos-emb + CLS, LayerNorm, 2D RoPE (GGML normal),
  bidirectional Xe2 XMX FlashAttention, LayerScale residual, and 2x2 spatial patch merge (0 spills).
- xpu_vit.zig: GGUF mmproj loader and GPU ViT encoder (+0.79 GB VRAM incl. 16K-token image pool).
- ink2.cl / xpu_main.zig: ink2_embed_mix_b (injects projected image embeddings raw without embed_norm)
  and --serve img protocol with prefix-cache compatibility across multi-turn image conversations.
- inkling2_serve.py: --mmproj flag, OpenAI image_url preprocessing (exact inkling2v align=40/-1 pad),
  SHA256 GPU image cache, and HTTP 400 guard when --mmproj is not loaded.
